---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/index.css';

const featureCards = [
	{
		title: 'Project Videos',
		description:
			'Follow practical builds, reviews and workshop experiments covering PCs, electronics and maker projects.',
		cta: 'Watch videos',
		href: 'https://www.youtube.com/@KingTechNL'
	},
	{
		title: 'Technical Blogs',
		description:
			'Read approachable write-ups, how-to content and engineering notes on hardware and software topics.',
		cta: 'Read blogs',
		href: '/blogs'
	},
	{
		title: 'About KingTech',
		description:
			'Explore the mission behind KingTech: sharing knowledge, testing new ideas and helping others build confidently.',
		cta: 'About us',
		href: '/aboutus'
	}
];

const highlightStats = [
	{ value: '10+', label: 'years exploring technology' },
	{ value: '3', label: 'core focus areas: hardware, software, maker culture' },
	{ value: '100%', label: 'hands-on, experiment-driven learning' }
];
---

<Layout
	title="KingTech | Discover, Build, Share"
	description="KingTech shares practical tech knowledge through videos, blogs and hands-on project stories."
>
	<div class="page-shell">


		<main>
			
			<section class="intro-block intro-accent-card">
				<div>
					<p class="section-label">What KingTech is about</p>
					<h2>Technology is better when it is explained clearly and shared openly.</h2>
				</div>
				<p>
					Technology plays a role in almost every part of daily life and in organizations around the
					world. At KingTech, we love exploring the latest developments in this space. Our projects
					cover a wide range of subjects, from 3D printing and industrial electronics to software and
					custom PCs. KingTech has seen it all. We not only bring deep technical experience, but also a
					strong belief in sharing knowledge. Through blogs and videos, we take our audience on a journey
					through new ideas and practical innovations, encouraging people to experiment and discover.
					The KingTech philosophy is simple: equip the tech community with the knowledge and tools to
					build amazing projects.
				</p>
			</section>

			<div class="media-card-grid">
				<article class="media-card">
					<img src="/videocreation.png" alt="KingTech YouTube" />
					<div class="media-card-body">
						<p>On our YouTube channel, you can find our latest projects and tech reviews. Interested in building a PC or server, or upgrading an old Xbox? We show you how it is done.</p>
						<a class="primary-button" href="/videos">Videos</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="media-card">
					<img src="/blogging.jpg" alt="KingTech Blogs" />
					<div class="media-card-body">
						<p>With more than a decade of experience in tech, KingTech explores the latest developments in both hardware and software. In our blogs, we share what we are building and provide practical guidance so you can do it yourself.</p>
						<a class="primary-button" href="/blogs">Blogs</a>
					</div>
				</article>
			</div>

		</main>

	</div>
</Layout>